      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] This TODO suggests that `mpu_config.num_regions` might be an unreliable limit for iterating over MPU regions on ARMv8-M. It would be better to address this now, e.g., by using the actual number of hardware regions from the `MPU_TYPE` register, to ensure all regions are correctly enabled.",
      "revId": "bc6d50a9b87a4fccf9f9b06a8f95c14a4aa5eaf0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
