      "writtenOn": "2026-05-21T02:48:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regions number from MPU_TYPE cannot be used here, because we don\u0027t know how many static regions are configured in zephyr.\nIn zephyr, the static regions can came from devicetree or custom defined mpu_regions.",
