      "writtenOn": "2026-05-15T22:23:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] The M33 path only adds `rollback0`, whereas the non-M33 path adds both `rollback0` and `rollback1`. If `rollback1` exists in the devicetree for M33 boards, it will be left unprotected by this code. Was this omission intentional?",
